            "answer": 0,
            "explain": "GitHub is a site, Git is a program."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Basic commands",
        "slides": [
          {
            "emoji": "📦",
            "text": "`git init` — we create an archive in the folder.\n`git add .` — we pack things into a parcel.\n`git commit -m \"message\"` — we seal the parcel with a description.\n`git push` — we send the parcel to GitHub."
          },
          {
            "quote": true,
            "text": "Write meaningful messages: «added a subscribe form». Don't write `fix` or `123`."
          }
        ],
        "check": [
          {
            "type": "match",
            "topic": "Commands",
            "prompt": "Match the command and the analogy",
            "pairs": [
              [
                "git add .",
                "We pack things into a parcel"
              ],
              [
                "git commit",
                "We seal the parcel"
              ],
              [
                "git push",
                "We send the parcel"
              ],
              [
                "git init",
                "We create an archive"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "choice",
            "topic": "Commands",
            "prompt": "Which commit message is good?",
            "options": [
              "added a subscribe form",
              "fix",
              "123",
              "asdf"
            ],
            "answer": 0,
            "explain": "The message should explain what changed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Branches and GitHub",
        "slides": [
          {
            "emoji": "🌱",
            "text": "A branch is a parallel version of the project so you don't break the main one:",
            "code": "git branch новая-ветка\ngit checkout -b новая-ветка"
          },
          {
            "text": "Connecting to GitHub:",
            "code": "git remote add origin ссылка-на-репозиторий\ngit push -u origin main"
          }
        ],
        "check": [
          {
            "type": "choice",
